        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI-SIG713-630 12 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese Brushed Stainless Steel 12\" Flush bolts (also known as door edge bolts) are installed into the edge of the door. They use a  Flip Style lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with stainless steel flush bolt assembly, strike plate and mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG713_size.gif?v=1704354540\" width=\"585\" height=\"205\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG713-630 12 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Bolt\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of AHI-SIG713-630 Flush Door Bolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
